{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A]The days are long and the nights are lonely
Since you [D]left me all [A]alone
I worry [D]so my little [A]darling
I worry [D]so since [E7]you've been [A]gone
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]Sweetheart of mine can't you hear me calling
A million [D]times I love you [A]best
I mistreated [D]you Lord and I'm [A]sorry
Come back to [D]me is [E7]my [A]request
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
I'll never forget the night we parted
A big mistake had caused it all
If you'll come back sunshine will follow
If you stay away it'll be my fall
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
The days are dark my little darling
Oh how I need your sweet embrace
When I woke up the sun was shining
When I looked up I saw your face
{end_of_chorus}
